--- anselm road 1 if station
  Topic {t}_anselm_lady with {t}_anselm "Tell {{t}_anselm} about the Lady of Wayfarers at the posting-house" when knows(party, {station}_wayfarer) once {
    Says "{{t}_anselm} listens with his hands folded, and when you have done he says nothing for so long that you begin to wonder. 'Waved on,' he says. 'Not worshipped. Asked only that the road be kind.' He looks at the lamp. 'If that is the oldest thing the people of this country do, and nobody ever told them to, and it asks for nothing, then I have a very large question about what the rest of what we do is *for*.' A breath. 'I shall go and see her. I shall go and see whether she waves at me.'".
    On discuss { Assert willing({t}_anselm, actor). Set hire({t}_anselm) to 0. }
  }
  Topic {t}_anselm_bowl with {t}_anselm "Ask {{t}_anselm} what he made of the Lady's bowl" when travelsWith({t}_anselm, party) and been(party, {station}_shrine) once {
    Says "'I left a coin,' says {{t}_anselm}. 'I told myself it was courtesy. And then the lamp steadied, and the draught went by the back of my neck, and I am a man who has read twelve treatises on the self-deception of the devout and I stood there and it did not feel like self-deception.' He is not smiling. 'It does not refute me. It does not refute *her* either. I have decided that is a good place to have got to by a Tuesday.'".
  }
--- anselm plain 1 unless station
  Topic {t}_anselm_join with {t}_anselm "Ask {{t}_anselm} to come and see where the coins come from" when been(party, {t}_stones_under) once {
    Says "'Under the hill,' says {{t}_anselm}, very quietly. 'The dead and their niches, and somebody's cup put back. You have been, and I have only read.' He looks at the shrine's lamp. 'The faith says the dead are in the keeping of the god. I should like to see what the dead keep. I will come, if you will have a clerk who prays badly when he is frightened.'".
    On discuss { Assert willing({t}_anselm, actor). Set hire({t}_anselm) to 0. }
  }
--- friction
  Topic {t}_anselm_cup with {t}_anselm "Ask {{t}_anselm} about the bronze cup" when travelsWith({t}_anselm, party) and holding(party, {t}_stones_cup_kind) once {
    Says "{{t}_anselm} has not taken his eyes from your pack since the undercroft. 'You will put it back,' he says. It is not quite a question. 'I will not argue the theology of it. There are things you do not carry out of a room because it would be easier. I would like to think we are the sort of company that knows which.'".
    On discuss { Assert {t}_an_insists(party). }
  }
  Observe {t}_anselm_relief at {t}_stones_under when state({t}_stones_niche, restored) and travelsWith({t}_anselm, party) "Brother Anselm Tarr lets out a breath you did not know he was holding. He does not say anything. He sets his hand flat on the stone beside the niche, once, and takes it away.".
